        "content": "What function values a receive-fixed, pay-equity-index swap with quarterly resets by solving for the future equity index level that makes the swap’s present value zero, using the initial index level, fixed annual rate, notional amount, remaining maturity, quarterly payment frequency, and a term structure of discount factors for fractional maturities?",
