      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    initial_equity_index = 100.0\n    fixed_rate = 0.03\n    notional_amount = 100_000_000.0\n    payment_frequency = 4\n\n    fixed_payment = (fixed_rate * notional_amount) / payment_frequency\n\n    # Present value factors for the three remaining quarterly payments\n    present_value_factors = [0.997506, 0.992556, 0.985222]\n\n    # The equity settlement occurs at the swap expiry\n    expiry_present_value_factor = present_value_factors[-1]\n\n    # Calculate the present value of the remaining fixed-leg payments\n    fixed_leg_present_value = fixed_payment * sum(present_value_factors)\n\n    # At zero value, the present value of the equity leg equals the fixed leg\n    required_equity_return = fixed_leg_present_value / (\n        notional_amount * expiry_present_value_factor\n    )\n\n    equity_index_level = initial_equity_index * (1 + required_equity_return)\n\n    # Return the index level rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(equity_index_level, 3)\n```",
